[ti:Aɣrib]
[ar:Lounès Matoub]
[al:Ṛwaḥ ṛwaḥ]
[length:4;44]
[by:Rayane Kch]
[00:21.44] Kecmeɣ di ssuq n tlufa
[00:33.17] Kecmeɣ di ssuq n tlufa
[00:36.78] Qḍiɣ-d leqsabi n lmeḥna
[00:39.50] Seg-sent hemmjeɣ kull ass
[00:45.82] Ɣef wul-iw ur tnuqel ccetwa
[00:59.27] Lebṛaq ṛṛɛud d usigna
[01:02.06] Rniɣ ṭṭlam timḍellas
[01:07.60] Lmut fell-i ur d-tnuda
[01:10.78] Yif-it limer i d-testeqsa
[01:13.40] Ad tɣumm leɛyub-iw meṛṛa
[01:21.04] Imi seg-i fukkent tissas
[01:27.89]
[01:36.12] Wiss ma d aɣrib ara mmteɣ
[01:39.95] Neɣ yiwen wass ad uɣaleɣ
[01:45.85] S akal i yi-d-yesnekren
[01:49.50] Leḥbab ukkud tturareɣ
[01:53.15] Deg uɣebbaṛ ukkud mṛaṛɣeɣ
[01:58.95] Wissen kan ma ad i-ɛeqlen
[02:02.65] Ma d taqcict-nni i kellxeɣ
[02:06.40] Ass mi as-nniɣ ad kem-aɣeɣ
[02:10.28] Taggara hujreɣ
[02:13.16] Ay hujreɣ rewleɣ
[02:19.81] Amek ara tt-qablent wallen
[02:29.65]
[02:36.08] Tseḥḥer-iyi lɣerba mm-leqwas
[02:40.53] S uḍaṛ-iw ɛefseɣ tissas
[02:46.16] Di taddart ṛẓag yisem-iw
[02:49.96] Ǧǧiɣ lalla-s n tullas
[02:53.83] Di tala reggment-tt tizya-s
[02:59.22] Uwiɣ ddnub i yiri-w
[03:03.08] Ay afrux ɣef ṭṭaq bedd-as
[03:07.05] Ɣef wucmit i yi-icban ḥder-as
[03:10.75] Fell-i ard ad teqḍeɛ
[03:13.11] Ar d ad teqḍeɛ layas
[03:20.24] Ad tezweǧ d win xir-iw
[03:27.17]
[03:35.41] Ad textir aqcic yeɣṛan
[03:39.26] Aneɛmar i ten-ijemmɛen
[03:44.91] Mačči am nekk umi yefla lǧib
[03:48.62] Bezzaf yettazzal lawan
[03:52.44] Aṭṭan n temẓi d ussan
[03:58.04] Ddwa-s bnadem ur t-iksib
[04:01.77] Nekk dayen yeǧǧa-yi zzman
[04:05.52] S ufus i d-uɣweɣ qeḍṛan
[04:09.24] Ḍliɣ-t i wudem-iw
[04:12.07] Ay i wudem-iw yuzzan
[04:18.76] Ur d-iggri deg yijifer-iw uḥbib
[04:28.52]
[04:35.92] Wiss ma d aɣrib ara mmteɣ
